<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.anzal1.Panoply</id>
  <name>Panoply</name>
  <summary>Every file tool in one fast app</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.anzal1">
    <name>Panoply contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT OR Apache-2.0</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>Panoply puts PDF, image, audio and video tools, and a universal file converter, in one open-source app. Nothing is uploaded; everything runs on your computer.</p>
    <p>Open a file, say what you want in plain words, and Panoply picks the tool. A command line tool and an MCP server ship with it.</p>
  </description>
